ists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_{S}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\\mathrm{RE}_{93}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RE}_{S}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\\mathrm{RE}_{93}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RE}_{S}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>RE₉₃ 仍为 RE_S 的精确别名。原外部文件缺失的内容直接补入本文件；无需另建一个只转引的节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"172b7ec1d3eb81a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"172b7ec1d3eb81a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合候选；$\\mathrm{RE}_{S}$ 在此补齐，$\\mathrm{RE}_{93}$ 保留原别名接口。机器程序与运行谓词来自 [[93-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_{S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_{S}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\lan